  "caveats": [
    "The unloaded floor's 248 prompts are the 2-RPS schedule's realized draw, not the redesigned canonical multiset. Its own tail is a sample, so the fit is anchored by roughly a dozen long prompts.",
    "The corpus-wide projection is a linear extrapolation, and the corpus reaches 44445 chars while the fit was observed only to 16781. Treat the projected p99 as an order-of-magnitude read, not a prediction.",
